  "_README": "Somalia national targeted-financial-sanctions list: the two lists issued by the National Anti-Money Laundering and Countering the Financing of Terrorism Committee (NAMLC) under Article 6 of the Targeted Financial Sanctions Act 2023, against Al-Shabaab financiers and leaders. Transcribed from the primary NAMLC PDFs (English versions), not from a secondary source. The NAMLC page \"Targeted Financial Sanction List\" (namlc.gov.so/targeted-financial-sanction-list/, read 2026-10-03) states that the Committee has issued two lists; both are here. Names are reproduced as printed, including the Somali-orthography forms and the spellings that differ between the numbered summary and the designee table of the first list (both kept as aliases). Single-word nicknames and English glosses of nicknames (e.g. \"the limp\") are kept in aka_unscreened and are not screened alone, as elsewhere in the registry. To refresh: check namlc.gov.so and frc.gov.so/list-of-financial-sanction-targets-copy/ for a further list, add its entries, and update lastReviewed.",
